      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "최근에는 메이클의 잎을 조합한\n향수를 만들어 보려고 하는데요...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CD5CADFCC5D0B2940020BA54C774D074C7580020C78EC7440020C870D569D55C000AD5A5C218B97C0020B9CCB4E4C5B40020BCF4B824ACE00020D558B294B370C694002E002E002E00100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "괜찮으시다면 메이클을\n데려와 주시겠어요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AD1CCC2EC73CC2DCB2E4BA740020BA54C774D074C744000AB370B824C6400020C8FCC2DCACA0C5B4C694003F00100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0004>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00040000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메이클을 지닌 포켓몬에 넣고\n데려와 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA54C774D074C7440020C9C0B2CC0020D3ECCF13BAACC5D00020B123ACE0000AB370B824C6400020C8FCC138C694002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "혹시 메이클의 잎을\n조금 나눠 주실 수 있을까요!?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D639C2DC0020BA54C774D074C7580020C78EC744000AC870AE080020B098B2200020C8FCC2E40020C2180020C788C744AE4CC6940021003F00100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그러면 메이클의 등에 달린 잎을\n한 꼬집만 실례할게요...!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7ECBA740020BA54C774D074C7580020B4F1C5D00020B2ECB9B00020C78EC744000AD55C0020AF2CC9D1B9CC0020C2E4B840D560AC8CC694002E002E002E002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "당장 이 잎을 이용해서\n향수를 조합해 봐야겠어요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2F9C7A50020C7740020C78EC7440020C774C6A9D574C11C000AD5A5C218B97C0020C870D569D5740020BD10C57CACA0C5B4C694002E00100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메이클 향수가\n완성됐어요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA54C774D0740020D5A5C218AC00000AC644C131B410C5B4C694002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메이클처럼 파릇파릇하면서\n에너지가 느껴지는<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n강렬한 잎사귀 향이네요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA54C774D074CC98B7FC0020D30CB987D30CB987D558BA74C11C000AC5D0B108C9C0AC000020B290AEF4C9C0B29400100001BE00000AAC15B82CD55C0020C78EC0ACADC00020D5A5C774B124C694002E00100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이 향기를 맡으니\n옛날 일이 떠올랐어요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7740020D5A5AE30B97C0020B9E1C73CB2C8000AC61BB0A00020C77CC7740020B5A0C62CB790C5B4C694002E00100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어릴 적에 메이클을 타고\n미르시티를 일주했던 기억이요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B9B40020C801C5D00020BA54C774D074C7440020D0C0ACE0000ABBF8B974C2DCD2F0B97C0020C77CC8FCD588B3580020AE30C5B5C774C694002E00100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어떻게 보면 이 향수는\n미르에서의 추억이 담겼다 할 수 있겠네요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B5BBAC8C0020BCF4BA740020C7740020D5A5C218B294000ABBF8B974C5D0C11CC7580020CD94C5B5C7740020B2F4ACBCB2E40020D5600020C2180020C788ACA0B124C694002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "여러 포켓몬의 도움을 받으면\n다른 멋진 향수도 만들 수 있을 것 같아요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5ECB7EC0020D3ECCF13BAACC7580020B3C4C6C0C7440020BC1BC73CBA74000AB2E4B9780020BA4BC9C40020D5A5C218B3C40020B9CCB4E40020C2180020C788C7440020AC830020AC19C544C694002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그때는 또 잘 부탁드릴게요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B54CB2940020B6100020C7980020BD80D0C1B4DCB9B4AC8CC694002E00100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
